	"Glassworks_Deluxe_Kiln_Fuel": "The artisan kiln requires mixed media supplies.",
	"Glassworks_Deluxe_Kiln_WrongIngredient": "Use a vaild non-gem, non-stone mineral and mixed media supplies to make a piece of deluxe glass art",

	//Mail

	"Leah_Kiln_Mail_Title": "A Gift From Leah",
	"Leah_Kiln_Mail_Greeting": "Hi there!",
	"Leah_Kiln_Mail_Text": "I've heard that you are exploring the mines. While you are down there you may come across geodes that contain all sorts of minerals inside. Did you know that if you mix one of those minerals with glass shards in a kiln you can make art out of glass? It's really fun!",
	"Leah_Kiln_Mail_Text2": "To get lots of glass shards, you need to grind up quartz, refined quartz or other foraged minerals. Doing it by hand isn't reccomended, so try it with a mill or watermill!",
	"Leah_Kiln_Mail_Text3": "I have sent over a Kiln to get you started! I can't wait to see your art!",
	"Leah_Kiln_Mail_End": "-Leah",

	"Wizard_Artificer_Mail_Title": "Artificer",
	"Wizard_Artificer_Mail_Greeting": "Greetings",
	"Wizard_Artificer_Mail_Text": "I had been working on a machine to automate blacksmithing, but it seems there is no replacing the hands of a skilled craftsman.",
	"Wizard_Artificer_Mail_Text2": "The machine I have sent to you is called an Artificer. It can create weapon handles from metal bars and create weaponry when given a handle and blade. Sadly the weapons produced are never any better than showpieces. Maybe you can find a use for it where I could not.",
	"Wizard_Artificer_Mail_End": "-M. Rasmodius, Wizard",
	"Rasmodia_Artificer_Mail_End": "-M. Rasmodia, Wizard",

